    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "はい、もしもし！　あ、やっほー！\r\nうん、うん…………えー！　そうだったんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "off",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（休憩中ずっと電話がかかってきている\r\nめぐるは友だちからとても好かれているんだろうな）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……うん、……うん。わかった！\r\nじゃあまた、今度ね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "電話、終わったのか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　……あ、ごめん！\r\nもしかしてうるさかったかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなことはないよ\r\n楽しそうなめぐるを見てると、俺も元気がもらえるしな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへー、そうかな！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、でも……こう電話がかかってくると、\r\nめぐるもなかなか休めないな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えー！\r\nそんなこと、考えたこともなかったよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "友だちと話すの、すっごく楽しいよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "その日あった面白いこととか聞いたりね、\r\nわたしも元気をもらってるんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、いっぱい電話が来ると休めないの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなことはないけど……\r\nでも、それだけ人と話せるのは一つの才能だと思うよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "才能かー、そうかなー！\r\nえへへー！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あ、でもね。いっぱい電話ができるのは嬉しいんだけど、\r\n困ったこともあって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "困ったこと？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん。携帯の電池が切れちゃうこともあるんだよね",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうすると、\r\nプロデューサーとも連絡できなくなっちゃうでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だからいつも、電池を気にしながら電話をしてるんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな\r\nそんなときは……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺とは直接話そう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "電話が無理なら\r\n直接会いに行けばいい",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "友だちとの連絡は\r\n家で済ませておこう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺と話すときは、\r\n電話を使わないで用事を伝えればいいだろ？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうすれば、携帯電話は友だちと電話するために\r\n使えるようになる",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "たしかに……そっか！\r\nそれ名案だよっ！　プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "じゃあ、プロデューサーがずーっと隣にいてくれたら、\r\n友だちといっぱい電話できるね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がいるから電話できるって……\r\n俺は電波の受信機か……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あはは！　プロデューサーが受信機だったら、\r\nわたしずっと持ち歩いちゃうな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0103"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "電話鳴ってるな\r\n出ても大丈夫だよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、ありがとう！\r\n……うん、もしもしっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（めぐるはうれしそうで仕事の連絡はしやすくなる……\r\n我ながらいいアイディアだったな！）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるも直接話したいだろう？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うーん、わたしも本当はそうしたいんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お仕事もあるし……\r\n友だちも予定があるからなかなか上手くいかないんだー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら時間を作れるように、俺がスケジュールを調整するよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほんとに！？　わーい！\r\nプロデューサー、ありがとう！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしも、お仕事をしっかりこなして、\r\nいっぱい時間を作れるようにするよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nじゃあ、もっと頑張らなくちゃな！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　……でもお仕事もちゃんとしたいから、\r\nいっぱい取ってきてね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（アイドルの仕事も友だちと話すこともできるように、\r\n俺がめぐるをしっかりとサポートしないとな！）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夜の間にいっぱい話をしておけば、\r\n昼間は仕事に専念できるんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっかー\r\nそういう方法もあるよね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、でも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたし、あんまり夜遅くまで起きてられないんだった\r\nんー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でもプロデューサーの言う通り、\r\n昼はアイドルのお仕事を頑張らなきゃ、だよね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんとか家で連絡を済ませるようにしてみるよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。それにいつもってわけにはいかないけど、\r\n仕事を頑張れば早めに帰ることもできるかもな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか！　そうすれば、お仕事も友だちとの電話も\r\nたくさんできるよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004020310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "よーし！　じゃあ、昼はバリバリお仕事して\r\n家で友だちと話そーっと！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300402/2003004020310"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]